@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}
<main aria-labelledby="title">
    <h2 id="title">@ViewBag.Title.</h2>
    <h3>@ViewBag.Message</h3>

    <p>
        Welcome to AS Employee Management System
        At AS Employee Management System, we are dedicated to streamlining and simplifying the way organizations manage their workforce. Our comprehensive platform offers an efficient, reliable, and user-friendly solution for handling employee data, attendance, payroll, and more.

        Who We Are
        Founded with a vision to enhance organizational productivity, AS Employee Management System combines cutting-edge technology with user-centric design. We aim to empower HR professionals and managers to make informed decisions, automate routine tasks, and improve overall employee engagement.

        Our Mission
        To deliver a robust, easy-to-use employee management solution that helps organizations optimize their human resources processes, reduce administrative overhead, and foster a productive work environment.

        Our Vision
        To be the leading provider of innovative HR management tools, continuously evolving to meet the dynamic needs of modern workplaces.

        What We Offer
        Employee Data Management
        Attendance and Leave Tracking
        Payroll Management
        Performance Monitoring
        Reports and Analytics
        Why Choose Us
        User-Friendly Interface: Designed for ease of use across all levels of users.
        Secure & Reliable: Ensuring data security and integrity.
        Customizable: Tailored features to suit your organization's unique needs.
        Dedicated Support: Our team is here to assist you every step of the way.
    </p>
</main>